            "review_title": "Review at Garni Bistro",
            "review_text": "ManuB22\nParis, France11 contributions\n0\nRestaurant highly recommandation\nMay 2021\nCosy French-inspired place, excellent food, very good pricing, nice welcome and good service.. Excellent and cheap daily set menu with also beside, a various dishes list\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 14, 2021\nRoving30190673027\n𝐃𝐞𝐚𝐫 𝐌𝐚𝐧𝐮𝐁22,\n\nThank you so much for the 5-Star review, that is the best thing we could hope for! Your review means a lot to us, we are constantly working harder and better everyday to improve the quality of our service and food for our dear customers.\nOnce again, thank you for choosing Garni Bistro and taking the time to share your experience.\nWe look forward to serving you for many years to come.\nRead more\nWritten May 16, 2021\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
