            "review_title": "Review at Garni Bistro",
            "review_text": "AdibPeb\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam586 contributions\n0\nGreat Fresh French Food\nApr 2021 • Family\nGrani Bistro in Thao Dien district will result in an amazing experience for you and your friends/guests . I promise. \n1. Fresh ingredients including Beef , Wagyu, Salmon etc. \n2. Generous Quantities \nFor sure .\n3. Excellent value for money \n4. French atmosphere \n5. Very quiet location\nRead more\nWritten April 15, 2021\nRoving30190673027\n𝐃𝐞𝐚𝐫 𝐀𝐝𝐢𝐛𝐏𝐞𝐛,\n\nSeeing that you had a 5-Star experience is the best thing we could hope for! Your review means a lot to us, we are constantly working harder and better everyday to improve the quality of our service and food for our dear customers.\nThank you for choosing Garni Bistro.\nWe look forward to welcoming you back very soon\nRead more\nWritten April 17, 2021\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
