            "review_title": "Review at Garni Bistro",
            "review_text": "THANH UY\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam10 contributions\n0\nThe only promising Michelin star restaurant in VN\nNov 2020\nIm not exaggerating anything. \nMy wife and I have had dinner at several 3 star and 2 star Michelin restaurant in Switzerland , Japan , Thailand.... We couldnt find any restaurant in Sai Gon that can be classified as \"fine dining\". Most are tasteless or lack of innovation. \n\n* The food : the quality of Garni can beat all the 1 star we ate , could be a 2 star in Europe, and maybe better than a 3 star Western restaurant in Japan ( in case you dont know , Japan has the most overrated 3 star Western cusine restaurants in the world). Some highly recommend dishes : crispy short ribs , Pan-fried fillet seabass oregano leaf w/ saffron sauce , pan-fried duck breast. \n\n*The staff : excellent.\nAnd they have special desserts not in menu , special dish of the day , special dinner set , and set lunch which is changed every 2-3 weeks.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten November 19, 2020\nRoving30190673027\n𝐃𝐞𝐚𝐫 𝐓𝐡𝐚𝐧𝐡 𝐔𝐲,,\n\nThank you very much for taking the time to share your experience at Garni Bistro. \nWe are especially happy that you enjoyed the food and had a delightful experience at Garni Bistro.\nOur team is constantly working hard every day to ensure the quality of our food and maintain the value of our service.\nWe look forward to your next visit.\nRead more\nWritten January 19, 2021\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
