            "review_text": "Neil F\n7 contributions\n0\nHidden Classic Classy Gem\nSep 2020\nJust a fantastic experience, the ultimate hidden gem.A beautiful menu with classic options and the cafe/bistro style down a lane is just perfect. \nThe owner was a lovely lady who spent time explaining dishes with suggestions and great service.\nIts a great atmosphere to coffee or dine. Look up, its through the little side entry and worth finding.\nEnjoyed it so much we took a months rental near bye so we can enjoy again.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 21, 2020\nRoving30190673027\n𝐃𝐞𝐚𝐫 𝐍𝐞𝐢𝐥 𝐅,\n\nThank you very much for taking the time to share your experience that you’ve had at Garni Bistro, it's our pleasure to serve you.\nWe are truly happy that our daily efforts have been reflected. We are constantly working harder and better everyday to improve the quality of our food and service.\nWe look forward to welcoming you back very soon !\nRead more\nWritten September 24, 2020\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
